\n總的來說~小吃餐館的餐飲食物很客觀，就是大眾見仁見智囉~🥰🥰",null,[0,129]]]],[],[null,null,4908,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvM01TZnhnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xccd344d9661d60b6!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCo3MSfxgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvM01TZnhnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvM01TZnhnRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvM01TZkpnEhJDZ3NJbWViNHZ3WVE4TlNpS0EaLQoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ01DbzNNU2ZwZ0USEkNnc0ltZWI0dndZUThOU2lLQSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEbZgHWbZRNPMKgswYnpZQk80MTlkaw\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjOztGz8NSWAxU5iK8BHTQMHA8QoykIlAEoCg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwijttqz8NSWAxVH7YsBHXmNGKkQ0pMFCEcoBA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjOztGz8NSWAxU5iK8BHTQMHA8Q0pMFCIMBKAQ"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaaFlMMGhBRRAB",["0x0:0xccd344d9661d60b6",null,1694668238455089,1714467776959949,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113447486489286882583/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["月","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1j5SVeHOcwXUbMgwqUDYcqwioPNKbL7dyvs8BJdJu_gtoe6kG\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113447486489286882583?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"113447486489286882583",null,383,1141,null,[1,8,1],60,["在地嚮導 · 383 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjOztGz8NSWAxU5iK8BHTQMHA8Qpr8GCJYBKAA"]]]],null,"上次編輯：2 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[3],null,[["CIHM0ogKEICAgIDZ4MqeCA",["CIHM0ogKEICAgIDZ4MqeCA",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPGiwBV4OMGhSbYiy3uItFhGXmIXfSUK8XZc1QJTw1Uak77WzMLeO4oeKt7YqgbcTf4TE4Xsl1qauDymjTysfzPo6OTFWjkV6iitauXT0jjNjESYdfurXHM7l0igtz6tMIwFALd\u003dk-no",null,[3648,2736]],null,[[3,121.44924297576948,25.177312066121345],[0,90],[3648,2736],75],"CrOaas6hJLmQvr0PtJjweA","0ahUKEwjOztGz8NSWAxU5iK8BHTQMHA8QzCcIlwEoAQ",["//www.google.com/local/